      <div type="clause" n="16">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 16</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ic beo eow swyðe hold hlaford þa hwyle þe me lif gelæst, ⁊ eow eallum swyðe bliðe eom, for ði þe ge swa georne ymbe frið syndon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">I will be a very gracious lord to you as long as my life lasts. I am very well pleased with you all, because you are so zealous for the preservation of the public peace.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ic beo eow swyðe hold hlaford þa hwile þe me lif gelæst, ⁊ eow eallum swyðe bliðe eom, for þý þe ge swa georne ymbe frið syndon.</ab>
      </div>
